==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|kol}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|kol}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*kulą}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*gʷol-}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*ǵwelH-||to burn, shine}}. Cognate with Dutch {{m|nl|kool}}, Danish {{m|da|kul}}, English {{m|en|coal}}.

